---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { offers, cta } from '@config/site';
---
<Base
  title="Competitive Decision Sprint"
  description="A focused competitive intelligence engagement that combines verified market evidence with your company context to support a real decision."
  path="/competitor-brief/"
>
  <section class="svc13-hero" data-surface="dark">
    <div class="container svc13-hero__inner">
      <span class="label">COMPETITIVE DECISION SPRINT</span>
      <h1>Turn competitive evidence into a decision.</h1>
      <p>A Complimentary Brief can show what is happening in the market. A Decision Sprint goes further: it brings your actual business context into the analysis and determines what the evidence means for the decision in front of your team.</p>
      <div class="svc13-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--lg" href={cta.secondary.href}>Discuss a Competitive Decision <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="svc13-link" href="/sample-report/">See the Sample Intelligence Brief →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container svc13-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="label">THE DIFFERENCE</span>
          <h2>This is not “more pages.”</h2>
          <p class="svc13-lede">The Gift proves the public competitive landscape. The Decision Sprint combines that evidence with information only your team can provide: what decision is live, where deals are being won or lost, which constraints matter, and what response is commercially realistic.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="svc13-panel">
          <small class="mono">ENGAGEMENT</small>
          <strong>{offers.decisionSprint.priceDisplay}</strong>
          <p>{offers.decisionSprint.priceNote}.</p>
          <small class="mono">DELIVERY</small>
          <b>{offers.decisionSprint.delivery}</b>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section svc13-muted">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="label">WHAT CHANGES IN A PAID SPRINT</span>
        <div class="svc13-cards">
          <article><b>01</b><h3>Real intake</h3><p>Your actual competitive question, upcoming decision, constraints and known deal context enter the analysis.</p></article>
          <article><b>02</b><h3>Priority validation</h3><p>We test whether the competitors that looked important from public evidence are actually decision-critical for your business.</p></article>
          <article><b>03</b><h3>Deeper decision analysis</h3><p>Pricing, product, positioning and claims are interpreted against your business context rather than in isolation.</p></article>
          <article><b>04</b><h3>Battlecard logic</h3><p>We identify likely objection, differentiation and response angles without presenting unsupported claims as fact.</p></article>
          <article><b>05</b><h3>Prioritized recommendations</h3><p>The output states what the evidence supports doing, what remains uncertain, and what should be checked next.</p></article>
          <article><b>06</b><h3>Executive package</h3><p>Executive Decision Deck + full Evidence Appendix + one revision round.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container svc13-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="label">THE EVIDENCE STANDARD</span>
          <h2>Decision support without pretending uncertainty disappeared.</h2>
          <p class="svc13-lede">Every material factual claim remains source-backed and human-reviewed. Fact, Inference and Unknown stay separated. Contradictions stay visible. Client context can change the decision — it cannot rewrite the public evidence.</p>
          <a class="svc13-link" href="/method/">See the Evidence Axis method →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="svc13-stack">
          <div><span>FACT</span><p>Directly supported by checked evidence.</p></div>
          <div><span>INFERENCE</span><p>Analytical conclusion built from disclosed facts.</p></div>
          <div><span>UNKNOWN</span><p>Evidence is not strong enough to claim certainty.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section svc13-final" data-surface="dark">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="label">START WITH THE DECISION</span>
        <h2>Send the context that changes what “better” means.</h2>
        <p>We will confirm the research boundary, scope and delivery in writing.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--lg" href={cta.secondary.href}>Discuss a Competitive Decision <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .svc13-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) 0;background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff}.svc13-hero__inner{max-width:68rem}.svc13-hero h1{max-width:13ch;margin:.8rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.2rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.055em}.svc13-hero p{max-width:54rem;color:#cbd8e8;font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.7}.svc13-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.7rem}.svc13-link{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:750;text-decoration:none}.svc13-hero .svc13-link{color:#dbe8ff}.svc13-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(16rem,.75fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:start}.svc13-grid h2,.svc13-final h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,4.2rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:.6rem 0 1rem}.svc13-lede{font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-muted)}.svc13-panel{padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--surface-border);border-radius:1rem;background:var(--bg-raised);display:grid;gap:.45rem}.svc13-panel strong{font:800 2rem/1 var(--font-display);margin-bottom:.35rem}.svc13-panel small{color:var(--text-faint);letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:.65rem}.svc13-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--text-muted)}.svc13-muted{background:var(--bg-raised)}.svc13-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:1.4rem}.svc13-cards article{padding:1.35rem;border:1px solid var(--surface-border);border-radius:.85rem;background:var(--bg)}.svc13-cards b{font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);font-size:.72rem}.svc13-cards h3{margin:.6rem 0 .45rem}.svc13-cards p{margin:0;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6}.svc13-stack{display:grid;gap:.75rem}.svc13-stack div{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--surface-border);border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--bg-raised)}.svc13-stack span{font:800 .72rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--accent)}.svc13-stack p{margin:.4rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted)}.svc13-final{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff}.svc13-final p{color:#cbd8e8;max-width:42rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}@media(max-width:820px){.svc13-grid,.svc13-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
